[Max Hi-Ougi counter]
description=Maxes the counter of how many latent abilities must activate to use Hi-Ougi.
patch=1,EE,00235B1C,extended,00000064

[Remove Hi-Ougi battle number restriction]
description=Remove the restriction of using a Hi-Ougi at most once every six random battles.
patch=1,EE,00235B84,extended,00000000

