[Automatic Blue Earth]
description=Activate Dual the Sun with Mao in the party. Works even on the 1st playthrough. Also extends enemy Hi-Ougi if Eugene Mao and Hilda are in the party, which may make the party transparent.
// You do not need to control Hilda like ritz code says.
patch=1,EE,D0145C64,extended,00000008
