[Automatic Blue Earth if available]
description=Activate Dual the Sun with Mao in the party. Only works on New Game+. Also extends enemy Hi-Ougi if Eugene Mao and Hilda are in the party, which may make the party transparent.
author=Sora3100
patch=1,EE,20145D10,extended,1000000A

